is are was were be been being become becomes became becoming
remain remains remained seem seems seemed feel feels felt
'''.split())
FUNCTION_WORDS = set('''
a an the this that these those my your his her its our their
I you he she it we they me us him them who whom whose which
is are was were be been being am do does did have has had
will would shall should may might can could must ought
of to in for on by at from with into as and or but if then
not no yes more most less least so too very quite even rather
'''.lower().split())
